    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Add focused tests around MsgPack/RPC transport behaviour and stable client API boundaries.\n\n## Motivation\n\nThe current generator will be replaced by the neutral model and emitter architecture in #31. Adding coverage around its internals now would create short-lived tests. Durable RPC/client behaviour still needs focused safety before that work.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Add missing tests for MsgPack request/response encoding and decoding.\n- Add missing tests for RPC transport and protocol/decode failures.\n- Add tests for stable client API boundaries where existing coverage is insufficient.\n- Keep unit and integration tests in the boundaries established by #29.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Current generator metadata/model internals.\n- Current identifier-emission implementation.\n- Golden tests for current generated C# output.\n- Neutral model/emitter tests, which belong in #31.\n- Client API or transport redesign.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Request/response encoding and decoding have focused coverage.\n- Decode, transport, and protocol failures fail clearly.\n- Added tests exercise behaviour intended to survive #31.\n- Existing unit and integration suites pass.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #29\n",
